---
/**
 * One organization on a cluster: members with roles, nested teams (open or
 * restricted), and app instances with their access rule. HTML boxes in the
 * theme tokens.
 */
---

<figure class="cal-org not-content">
	<div class="org">
		<div class="head">
			<span class="k">Organization · acme</span>
			<span class="roles">owner · admin · member · guest</span>
		</div>
		<div class="cols">
			<div class="col">
				<span class="k">Teams</span>
				<ul class="tree">
					<li><b>Engineering</b> <em>open</em>
						<ul><li><b>Backend</b> <em>open</em></li></ul>
					</li>
					<li><b>Finance</b> <em class="r">restricted</em>
						<ul><li><b>Payroll</b> <em>open, under Finance</em></li></ul>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class="col">
				<span class="k">App instances</span>
				<ul class="apps">
					<li><b>chat</b> <code>access: org</code><span>every member</span></li>
					<li><b>ledger</b> <code>access: team · Finance</code><span>Finance's members only</span></li>
					<li><b>notes</b> <code>access: owner</code><span>its owner only</span></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<figcaption>
		Open teams take everyone who reaches their parent; a restricted team is a wall. Each instance has its own state and
		its own access rule.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cal-org {
		margin: 1.75rem 0;
	}
	.org {
		border: 1px solid var(--cal-ink);
		background: var(--cal-card);
	}
	.head {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 12px 16px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
	}
	.roles {
		font: 500 0.78rem/1.4 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--cal-muted);
	}
	.cols {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
	}
	.col {
		padding: 14px 16px 16px;
		min-width: 0;
	}
	.col + .col {
		border-left: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
	}
	.k {
		font: 600 0.7rem/1.4 var(--sl-font-mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	ul {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 10px 0 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.tree ul {
		margin: 6px 0 0 14px;
		padding-left: 12px;
		border-left: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
	}
	li {
		margin: 6px 0;
		color: var(--cal-ink);
	}
	em {
		font: normal 500 0.72rem/1 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--cal-muted);
		margin-left: 6px;
	}
	em.r {
		color: var(--cal-seal);
	}
	.apps li {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2px;
		padding: 8px 10px;
		border: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
		background: var(--cal-paper);
	}
	.apps code {
		font: 500 0.75rem/1.3 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--cal-ink-2);
	}
	.apps span {
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: var(--cal-muted);
	}
	figcaption {
		margin-top: 10px;
		font: 400 0.8rem/1.5 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--cal-muted);
	}
	@media (max-width: 34rem) {
		.col + .col {
			border-left: 0;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--cal-rule);
		}
	}
</style>
